    "subRegion": null,
    "subHeader": "Incorporate in the UK to access global financial markets, top-tier talent, and robust commercial legal frameworks. Establish your business in the UK with Arnifi today!\n",
    "blogs": [],
    "overviewDetail": "The United Kingdom is a premier global economic center, renowned for transparent legal governance, highly developed financial systems, and access to international capital. Headquartered in London, businesses benefit from a thriving ecosystem of venture capital, innovation hubs, and a highly skilled workforce. The UK common law framework provides superior commercial security and intellectual property protection recognized worldwide. Incorporation is fast and cost-effective, offering 100% foreign ownership and remote corporate setup without mandatory minimum capital requirements.\n\n Additionally, an extensive bilateral network of over 130 double taxation treaties helps multinational entities optimize cross-border operations. Whether scaling a technology startup, expanding e-commerce, or establishing a regional headquarters, the UK provides an agile, credible, and globally connected foundation for long-term business growth.\n",
    "jurisdiction": [],
    "banner": [
      {
        "url": "https://arnifi-be-prod-assets.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/uk_img1_780ed18626.jpg"
      }
